flowchart LR
    U[Resumable upload] --> RAW[(Raw bucket)]
    RAW -->|event| Q[Transcode queue]
    Q --> T[Workers: rendition ladder + thumbnails]
    T --> SEG[Segment + package HLS/DASH]
    SEG --> OUT[(Delivery bucket)]
    OUT --> CDN[CDN]
    CDN --> PL[Player: ABR picks rendition per segment]
    T -.->|progress| ST[processing → ready]
